						"description": "Creates a new user account (admin only), as multipart/form-data so the profile image can be uploaded in the same request.\n\n**Body (form-data)**\n- `first_name` (string, required)\n- `last_name` (string, required)\n- `email` (string, required) \u2014 must be unique among active (non-deleted) users\n- `phone` (string, optional) \u2014 must be unique among active (non-deleted) users if provided\n- `password` (string, required, min 8 chars) \u2014 hashed server-side, never stored in plaintext\n- `image` (file, optional) \u2014 JPEG/PNG/WebP, max 5MB. Can also be set later via 'Update user image'."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "List users",
