						"description": "Updates a user's details (admin only), as multipart/form-data. Only the fields you include are changed.\n\n**Body (form-data)**\n- `first_name` (string, optional)\n- `last_name` (string, optional)\n- `email` (string, optional) \u2014 must stay unique among active (non-deleted) users\n- `phone` (string, optional) \u2014 must stay unique among active (non-deleted) users\n- `status` (enum, optional) \u2014 one of: active, inactive, suspended, pending_verification\n- `user_type` (enum, optional) \u2014 one of: public, private (private = admin access)\n- `image` (file, optional) \u2014 JPEG/PNG/WebP, max 5MB"
					}
